  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CITI- Solar Dryer Installation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the instillation of a solar dryer (30x100ft) to help protecting coffee against rainfall and direct sunshine. Contaminations of the earth, mold and uncontrollable heat will also be overcome, improving the quality of the coffee product and specialty coffee produced. Drying beds and drying racks will be installed as well so that the solar dryer accommodates 4 metric tons per round for a period of 3 days. At this stage, the group will in position to handle the voluminous coffees produced by the 1705 farmers every season throughout the year.</narrative>
  </description>
